    "title": "One dead after Monday night shooting in Richland County - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Marley Bassett ,\n1 days ago COLUMBIA, S.C. (WIS) - One person is dead following a shooting on Monday night in Richland County. The Richland County Sheriff’s Department said that deputies responded to a scene at the 8100 block of Bayfield Road around 10:30 p.m. on Monday after getting reports of a shooting in the area. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 3",
